---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import { useTranslations } from '../../i18n/translations';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return [
    { params: { lang: 'id' } },
    { params: { lang: 'en' } },
  ];
}

const { lang } = Astro.params;
const t = useTranslations(lang as 'id' | 'en');
---

<Layout title="Case Study Detail - ConsultIT">
  <main class="flex-grow">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <a
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-medium group text-sm"
          href="/cases"
        >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-x-1"
            >arrow_back</span
          >
          <span>Back to Portfolio</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary/70 mb-2">Cloud Infrastructure</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tighter">
            Cloud Infrastructure Overhaul for a Fintech Leader
          </h1>
          <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-lg mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Achieved 30% cost reduction and improved scalability through a seamless cloud migration
            to AWS.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white dark:bg-card-dark rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden mb-16 border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark"
        >
          <img
            alt="Fintech project showcase"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
            src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDAPluHVK5SOwtpbCeDfoxV_H85XWe83TbPh2uf5KEMyTYSlgnCPlYn3aGDQ3ar2OtPRxRk-zmAn92yHb43tpq4en9BqYsJSvs3kSVZA9cJW0FMx92eqQL31mmSc_atPnZN5R2oUELmCWMauABj77AgxOZfzYLppKXKWq_aa9eE86xzI23pUjW413NRn1-Hi7CPUKqyYxC3kemViYhRMsoSxRYzQ_Fqx-ZjhfZXlwUuOA8W-xGZ1QnobzFFn2A842PomAmPqalLxUc"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-12">
          <div class="md:col-span-1">
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div>
                <h3
                  class="text-sm font-semibold text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark tracking-wider uppercase mb-2"
                >
                  Client
                </h3>
                <p class="text-base font-medium">Fintech Solutions Inc.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3
                  class="text-sm font-semibold text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark tracking-wider uppercase mb-2"
                >
                  Services
                </h3>
                <p class="text-base font-medium">
                  Cloud Migration, DevOps, Scalability Consulting
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3
                  class="text-sm font-semibold text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark tracking-wider uppercase mb-2"
                >
                  Timeline
                </h3>
                <p class="text-base font-medium">6 Months</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div
            class="md:col-span-2 space-y-10 text-lg text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark leading-relaxed"
          >
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-light dark:text-text-dark mb-4">
                The Challenge
              </h2>
              <p>
                Fintech Solutions Inc. was experiencing rapid growth, but their on-premise
                infrastructure couldn't keep up. They faced significant challenges with scalability,
                rising maintenance costs, and slow deployment cycles, which hampered their ability to
                innovate and respond to market demands.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-light dark:text-text-dark mb-4">
                Our Solution
              </h2>
              <p>
                We devised a comprehensive cloud migration strategy tailored to their specific needs.
                This involved a phased migration to Amazon Web Services (AWS), containerizing
                applications using Docker and Kubernetes for better portability, and implementing a
                full CI/CD pipeline to automate deployments and improve efficiency.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-light dark:text-text-dark mb-4">
                The Results
              </h2>
              <ul class="space-y-4">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-1">check_circle</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>30% Reduction in Operational Costs:</strong> By moving to a pay-as-you-go
                    cloud model, the client significantly cut down on hardware and maintenance expenses.</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-1">check_circle</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>5x Faster Deployment Cycles:</strong> The new CI/CD pipeline and automated
                    infrastructure provisioning reduced deployment times from weeks to just hours.</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-1">check_circle</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>Enhanced Scalability & Reliability:</strong> The new AWS infrastructure
                    provided auto-scaling capabilities, ensuring 99.99% uptime and seamless performance
                    during peak traffic loads.</span
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div
              class="bg-white dark:bg-card-dark border-l-4 border-primary p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm"
            >
              <p class="text-lg italic text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark leading-relaxed">
                "Working with ConsultIT was a game-changer for us. Their expertise in cloud solutions
                not only modernized our infrastructure but also positioned us for future growth. The
                results speak for themselves."
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-text-light dark:text-text-dark">
                — CEO, Fintech Solutions Inc.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
